# Piano-PC overlay

`os/home/` is copied onto the Linux piano PC by `deploy.ps1`:

- `os/home/<folder>` → `/home/<user>/<folder>`
- `app/` → `/home/<user>/CarlaInterface/` (skips `.venv` and `__pycache__`)
- `--app-only` / `-AppOnly` copies only the app and leaves the overlay untouched

Autostart lives under `os/home/.config/autostart/`; scripts under `os/home/startup_scripts/`. Do not rewrite JACK patchbays, Carla `.carxp` projects, or autostart unless asked.
